WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.072
Get_profit returns the difference between sales and costs.

00:00:04.072 --> 00:00:09.677
When we call it with one thousand and eight hundred, the returned value is two hundred.

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:13.583
That value is stored in the variable profit and then printed.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:21.315
Because the value was returned, we could just as easily use it in a tax calculation, a margin calculation,

00:00:21.315 --> 00:00:28.113
or another report. That makes return much more flexible than printing inside every function.
